cause: (1) It\'s the weakest card in my hand, so I want to get rid of it while I have the lead, (2) The Landlord is very likely to beat it or pass, and if they beat it with one of their 2 remaining cards, they\'re down to 1 card but now have control, (3) If they pass, my teammate will likely take it and gain control with 2 cards vs Landlord\'s 2, giving our team a better position, (4) I preserve ♠7 as a potentially winning card for the final play.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♦3"]}'}
